-- counter.rofl — ticks demo: emits 1..5 as intention facts, then quiesces.
-- Persistence is not a storage property: counter survives only because the
-- @next rule carries it (until N reaches 5, after which the world empties).

counter(1) @init.
counter(M) @next :- counter(N), N < 5, M is N + 1.
emit(N) :- counter(N).
